I've been carrying two Pokémon Fossils,
but they're just so heavy...{VAR BE01}
Would you take one of them off my hands?

Oh, you like the Cover Fossil?{VAR BE01}
I heard it is the Fossil of a Pokémon
that used to swim in the ancient sea!{VAR BE01}

Oh, you like the Plume Fossil?{VAR BE01}
It is the Fossil of a bird Pokémon
that lived in an ancient forest.{VAR BE00}
...But they say it couldn't fly.{VAR BE01}

The museum in Nacrene City...{VAR BE01}
I hear Pokémon can be restored from
Fossils there.{VAR BE01}
'Cause Lenora loves bones and Fossils!

Trainer! You still can't move ahead
'cause there is so much sand!{VAR BE01}
I will do my best to remove the sand.
Give me a second!{VAR BE01}

There are two things I've learned
about quicksand!{VAR BE01}
If you try to walk through the middle,
you'll fall.{VAR BE01}
And if you try to run through it,
you'll fall.
